// EXPECT-ERROR: element 0 of the comprehension does not fold, because "twice( 0 )" does not - it calls a routine
// EXPECT-AT: 7:35
// A routine runs when the program does, so a body calling one cannot fold - and
// the resolver says so before any call graph is built (§76).
u16 twice( u16 n ) => n * 2

const u16[4] t = [ for ( i in 4 ) twice( i ) ]
